Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分：循环归框架管\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2: frameworks own the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.43,0:00:06.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次不用 Docker：Google 的 Agent Development Kit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No Docker this time: Google's Agent Development Kit runs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:09.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑在你笔记本上的一个 uv 环境里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in a uv environment on your laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.41,0:00:12.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打开一个新终端，进到你放 clone 的地方\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Open a new terminal where you keep your clones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:16.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 步：clone；README 里的地址写的是一个占位符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 1: clone; the README writes a placeholder for the address.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.78,0:00:21.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下一行写的是：cd google-adk-tutorial，可是并没有这个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The next line says cd google-adk-tutorial, but no such folder exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.17,0:00:25.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个小疏漏：目录名和 repo 名一样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the folder is named after the repo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.79,0:00:29.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,改成输入：cd llm-agent-google-adk\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Type cd llm-agent-google-adk instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:33.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的 ls 显示有六个带编号的模块目录，但没有 lock 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra ls shows six numbered module folders, but no lock file:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:37.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 忽略了它，所以每个人都会重新解析出最新的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the repo ignores it, so everyone resolves fresh versions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:41.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来，把 .env.example 复制成 .env 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, copy .env.example to .env.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:45.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的 grep 显示了一个占位的 Google API 密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra grep shows a placeholder Google API key,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.93,0:00:48.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有模型：gemini-2.5-flash\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the model, gemini-2.5-flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:52.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后在 Google AI Studio 里创建一个密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then create a key in Google AI Studio,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:56.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,粘贴到 .env 里 Google API key 的等号后面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and paste it into .env, after GOOGLE_API_KEY=.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.27,0:00:58.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型那一行也要改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Also change the model line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.36,0:01:04.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,选 LLM 核心是课上的第一个设计决定，而在这里它只是一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Choosing the LLM core is the lecture's first design decision, and here it's one line:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.78,0:01:08.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,换成当前的模型，比如 gemini-3.1-flash-lite\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a current model, like gemini-3.1-flash-lite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:13.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Google 把代码里的后备模型 gemini-2.0-flash 列为已停用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Google lists the code's fallback, gemini-2.0-flash, as shut down,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:17.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,又把 gemini-2.5-flash 限定给老用户使用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and limits gemini-2.5-flash to earlier users.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.35,0:01:19.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所有设置都放在根目录这个文件里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Keep everything in this root file:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.54,0:01:21.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只会加载离得最近的那个 .env 文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}only the nearest .env is loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:23.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把你的设置好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and set up yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.80,0:01:32.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,项目文件要求 Python 3.10 及以上、ADK 1.8 及以上，没有上限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The project file wants Python 3.10 or newer and ADK 1.8 or newer, with no upper bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:36.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,文件里还列了 Chroma 和 sentence-transformers\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It also lists Chroma and sentence-transformers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:39.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再补充一点：这台笔记本上根本没有 Python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One more fact: this laptop has no Python at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:48.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后安装：uv sync\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then install: uv sync.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.87,0:01:52.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和第 1 讲一样，周围没有 Python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}As in lecture 1, with no Python around,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.41,0:01:58.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,uv 就下载最新的：录制时是 CPython 3.15.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}uv downloads the newest: CPython 3.15.0, at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.65,0:02:02.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它解析了 189 个包，然后失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It resolves 189 packages, then fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.51,0:02:05.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Chroma 引入的 onnxruntime\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}onnxruntime, which Chroma pulls in,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.64,0:02:08.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有到 Python 3.14 为止的 wheel\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}has wheels only up to Python 3.14.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.92,0:02:14.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以这一步只要 uv 选中 3.15 就会失败：在全新的笔记本上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So this step fails whenever uv picks 3.15: on a fresh laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:18.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,或者 uv 已经有 3.15 的地方，哪怕旁边还有更旧的 Python\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}or where uv already has 3.15, even beside an older Python.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:23.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修复办法是一条额外的命令：uv python pin 3.13\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix, with an extra command: uv python pin 3.13.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:29.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后再跑一次：uv sync，这次用的是 CPython 3.13\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then uv sync again: CPython 3.13 this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.87,0:02:33.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,安装成功，ADK 2.12.0 也装上了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and it installs, ADK 2.12.0 included.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:35.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,PyTorch 让它变得很大\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}PyTorch makes it big:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:41.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,大约 1.6 GB，在 Linux 电脑上还要再加大约 3 GB 的 CUDA\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}about 1.6 gigabytes, plus about 3 gigabytes for CUDA on a Linux PC.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:49.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查一下：uv run adk --version，录制时显示 2.12.0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra check, uv run adk --version, says 2.12.0, at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:51.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，让你的 sync 跑成功\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and get your sync to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.13,0:02:57.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Running Agents 一节的第 1 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Running Agents, step 1,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:03:00.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 repo 根目录下：uv run adk web\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}from the repository root: uv run adk web.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.02,0:03:05.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,首先，2.12 版会问一个问题，README 里没提\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, version 2.12 asks a question the README doesn't mention:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.93,0:03:08.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可以让 Google 收集使用数据吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}may Google collect usage data?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:11.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,提示文字说遥测默认是关闭的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The text says telemetry is off by default,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:14.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可大写的 Y 意味着直接按回车就是回答 yes\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the capital Y means pressing enter answers yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:16.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,怎么回答都行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Answer as you like;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.71,0:03:19.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以后可以用这条命令改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}change it later with this command:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.39,0:03:21.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,uv run adk telemetry disable\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}uv run adk telemetry disable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.92,0:03:24.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后服务器启动了，在 port 8000 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the server starts, on port 8000.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.01,0:03:28.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 步：在浏览器里打开 localhost:8000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Step 2: open localhost:8000 in your browser;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:32.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的 curl 显示它重定向到了 dev UI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an extra curl shows the redirect to the dev UI.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:36.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 agent 下拉菜单列出了 7 项，嵌套的也算在内\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The agent dropdown lists 7 entries, nested ones included.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:41.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按它的 README 选 1-baseline，页面拒绝了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pick 1-baseline, as its README says, and the page refuses:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:44.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,agent 名必须是合法的 Python 标识符\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}agent names must be valid Python identifiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:48.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么？每个目录名都会变成 app 名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why? Each folder name becomes the app's name,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:54.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而标识符只能包含字母、数字和下划线，并且不能以数字开头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and an identifier holds only letters, digits and underscores, never starting with a digit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:57.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个名字 1-baseline，两条规则都违反了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The name 1-baseline breaks both rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:04:02.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,旧版本 1.27.5 只列出那四个目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An older version, 1.27.5, lists only the four folders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:06.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但选一个还是失败，原因是 app 名不合法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But picking one still fails, as an invalid app name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 pin 版本没用；我们也把自己的 pin 撤掉了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So a version pin doesn't help; we undid ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.13,0:04:14.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,管用的是改名，这也不在 README 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What works is renaming, which isn't in the README either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.78,0:04:18.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先按 Ctrl-C 停掉服务器，再去掉每个开头的数字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Stop the server with Ctrl+C, then drop each leading number,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:21.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把连字符换成下划线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and turn hyphens into underscores.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:24.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再启动一次 web 服务器，选 baseline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Start the web server again, and pick baseline.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.47,0:04:28.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,日志说它加载了 repo 根目录下的 .env\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The log says it loaded the .env at the repository root,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:31.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并在 baseline.agent 里找到了 root agent\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and found the root_agent in baseline.agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:36.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有两个小疏漏：快速入门在该传目录的地方传了一个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two more slips: the quick start passes a file where a folder is expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:38.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,各模块的 README 又漏了 web 这个词\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the module READMEs drop the word web,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:40.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以命令只会打印帮助信息\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so it only prints help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:45.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果 llm-rag 的 Chroma 还占着 port 8000，两边就会冲突\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And if llm-rag's Chroma still holds port 8000, they clash;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:48.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,web 服务器停了：address already in use\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the web server stopped: address already in use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:53.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先运行 docker compose down，或者加上 --port 8080\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run docker compose down first, or add --port 8080.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.73,0:04:56.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，在 dev UI 里打开 baseline\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and get the dev UI open on baseline.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:02.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 baseline 里，有三个 LLM agent\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Baseline holds three LLM agents,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:06.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个都有一个模型、一条指令和一个 output key\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}each with a model, an instruction, and an output_key.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:11.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对应课上的组件：LLM 核心、指令，完全没有工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the lecture's blocks: the LLM core, the instructions, and no tools at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:17.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,顺序 agent 依次运行它们：校验器、规划器、总结器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A sequential agent runs them in order: validator, planner, summarizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:20.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个额外的请求显示了 UI 加载的那棵树\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra request shows the tree the UI loads,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:23.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型来自你根目录的 .env\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with the model from your root .env;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.08,0:05:26.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,核对一下你的。另一个额外的请求创建了一个 session\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}check yours. Another extra request creates a session:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:29.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,状态是空的，也还没有事件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}an empty state, and no events yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.67,0:05:31.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把状态想成一块共享的白板\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Think of the state as a shared whiteboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.22,0:05:34.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,等你加上密钥，Runner 就会这样做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Once you add your key, the Runner does this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.95,0:05:39.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,校验器的回复写进状态，放在它的 output key 下面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The validator's reply goes into the state, under its output_key;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.02,0:05:44.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,规划器运行之前，它指令里的占位符会用那一格的内容填上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}before the planner runs, its instruction's placeholder is filled from that cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.98,0:05:47.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,总结器也用同样的方式读取计划\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The summarizer reads the plan the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:50.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些 agent 从不互相调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The agents never call each other:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.11,0:05:54.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,数据由 session 携带，放在它的状态和事件历史里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the session carries the data, in its state and its history of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:57.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并行 agent 会同时填满它的格子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A parallel agent fills its cells at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.50,0:06:00.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的旅行规划需要实时系统\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's planner needs live systems;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:04.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条 pipeline 没有工具，所以里面的价格都是模型猜的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this pipeline has no tools, so its prices are the model's guesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.67,0:06:08.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,后面一个 notebook 的价格来自工具，总和由 Python 计算\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A later notebook gets prices from tools and sums from Python.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.13,0:06:11.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,ADK 的 README 把这叫作记忆\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The ADK README calls this memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:15.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码里叫它 session 状态，只持续一个 session\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The code calls it session state, and it lasts one session;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:20.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上说的记忆，下次还会记得你，而今天的运行一个都做不到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the lecture's memory remembers you next time, which none of today's runs does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:24.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有真正的密钥，旅行请求会得到 Internal Server Error\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without a real key, a trip request gets an Internal Server Error.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:28.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务器日志说明了原因：API key not valid\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The server log says why: API key not valid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.88,0:06:31.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,占位密钥发到了 Google，被拒绝了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The placeholder reached Google, and was refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:35.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，要找的是：按顺序的三条回复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With your key, look for three replies in order,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.78,0:06:38.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以及 State 标签页里新增的三项\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and three new entries in the State tab;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:41.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 session 是 agent 目录里的一个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the session is a file in the agent's folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:45.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个请求是三次模型调用：暂停一下，规划一次旅行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each request is three model calls: pause, and plan a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.57,0:06:51.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把工具分成三类\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture sorts tools into three families.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.45,0:06:54.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,数据工具负责获取，比如我们的搜书工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Data tools fetch, like our book searches;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:59.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,行动工具会改变某些东西，比如敲定行程或者发邮件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}action tools change something, like finalizing a trip or sending email;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.34,0:07:02.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,编排工具把工作交给另一个 agent\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}orchestration tools hand work to another agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.88,0:07:07.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在把一个 agent 接到十个服务上，每个服务都有自己的协议\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now wire one agent to ten services, each with its own protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:10.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上问：你看出问题了吗？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture asks: do you see a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:17.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个工具都要做一次定制集成\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every tool becomes a custom integration.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.30,0:07:22.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,MCP，也就是模型上下文协议，把它变成一种模式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}MCP, the Model Context Protocol, makes it one pattern:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.37,0:07:26.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 host 带着若干 client，每个服务对应一个 MCP server\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a host with clients, and an MCP server for each service.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:31.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上那个 MCP 方框是一个共享的协议，不是一个要你运行的程序\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's MCP box is a shared protocol, not a program you run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:35.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在代码里，每个 server 都是一个单独的插头，教程里有三个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In code, each server is its own plug, and the tutorial has three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:39.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 1 个插头在 ADK 讲 MCP 的那个模块里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Plug 1 is in the ADK module on MCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.79,0:07:41.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,安装 Node\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Install Node.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:48.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 agent 的工具集用 npx 启动一个文件系统 server\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The agent's toolset starts a filesystem server with npx,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:52.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,作为子进程；它通过标准输入输出通信\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as a child process, talking over standard input and output.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:57.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个额外的脚本向这个工具集要它的工具列表，完全不涉及模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra script asks that toolset for its tools, with no model involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:08:02.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 server 提供 14 个，包括写入和编辑，过滤器放行了三个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The server offers 14, including write and edit, and the filter lets three through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.87,0:08:05.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有密钥的话，让 agent 列出文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With your key, ask the agent to list files.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:09.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 个插头回到 Cheese Quiz 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Plug 2 is back in the Cheese Quiz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:13.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先是第一个工具，写成普通函数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}After a first tool written as a plain function,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:17.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 notebook 按 URL 连上一个远程 MCP server\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the notebook connects to a remote MCP server by URL,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:20.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,作为 MCP servers 参数传进去，而不是 tools\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}passed as mcp_servers, not tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:23.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的几条 curl 命令和这个 server 对话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Extra curl commands talk to that server.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:26.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,浏览器的普通请求得到 406\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A browser's plain request gets 406:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:30.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,server 在运行，但它说的是 MCP，不是网页\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the server is up, but speaks MCP, not web pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.77,0:08:32.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是初始化、列出工具、调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then initialize, list tools, call:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:35.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个工具，每次调用一条奶酪冷知识\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one tool, one cheese fact per call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.83,0:08:38.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 个插头是可选的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Plug 3 is optional:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.57,0:08:42.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 自己起一个 FastMCP server\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the notebook runs its own FastMCP server,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:44.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跑在一个线程里，在 port 8001 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}in a thread, on port 8001.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.00,0:08:50.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个小疏漏：上面的注释写的是 8000，一份较早保存的输出也是\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the comment above says 8000, and so does an older saved output.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.25,0:08:58.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,注意是谁在负责通信：你的 client 进程\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Notice who does the talking: your client process.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.62,0:09:03.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,MCP 并没有给模型任何网络访问权限；它仍然只是写出调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}MCP gives the model no network access; it still only writes calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:05.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，把 MCP 的单元格跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause, and run the MCP cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:12.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的深度研究是一棵 agent 树\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the lecture, deep research is a tree of agents:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.69,0:09:15.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个主 agent、一个规划器、几个并行的网页搜索 agent\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a lead agent, a planner, parallel web searchers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.93,0:09:17.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后汇总成一份报告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a synthesis into a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.28,0:09:22.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,教程搭了类似的树：Cheese Quiz Guild，还有简报\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tutorial builds trees like it: the Cheese Quiz Guild, and the newsletter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.93,0:09:27.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的规划器引出了区分它们的问题：顺序由谁来定？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's planner raises the question that sorts them: who plans the order?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.80,0:09:29.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一种答案：代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First answer: the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:34.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,顺序 agent 就是一条流水线，顺序在 Python 里写死\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The sequential agent is an assembly line, its order fixed in Python.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:37.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二种答案：模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Second answer: the model.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.20,0:09:41.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Guild 里，每个专家 agent 都变成一个工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the Guild, each specialist becomes a tool:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:43.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个函数背后是一整个 agent\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a whole agent behind one function.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:46.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,由一个编排 agent 决定调用哪一个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An orchestrator decides which to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:51.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的指令写着：严格按流水线来，最多 2 轮审查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its instructions say: follow the assembly line strictly, at most 2 review rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.07,0:09:53.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是写在文字里的规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's a rule in prose;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.71,0:09:56.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有代码去强制执行它，除了 12 轮的上限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}no code enforces it, except a cap of 12 turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:10:01.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课程团队保存的运行报了三次获取回复的错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The staff's saved run logged three errors getting a response,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:02.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,却还是生成了一份测验\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and still produced a quiz;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.75,0:10:05.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,日志没说是哪些调用失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the log doesn't say which calls failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:08.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每多一跳，就多一份成本、一段时间和一种失败的可能\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every hop adds cost, time, and a way to fail;
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.53,0:10:10.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑一遍 Guild\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pause, and run the Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.33,0:10:17.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三种答案：Python，读取模型给的标签\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Third answer: Python, reading the model's label.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:21.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这个自定义 agent 里，一个分类器往状态里写一个词\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In this custom agent, a classifier writes one word into the state,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.77,0:10:24.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再由普通的 if 语句选出处理函数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and plain if statements pick the handler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.13,0:10:33.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,走的是 else 分支：clarification\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The else branch: clarification.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.52,0:10:39.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,比较是精确匹配；先把标签转成小写，或者要求结构化输出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The comparison is exact; lowercase the label first, or ask for structured output.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:41.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,练习里两种办法都会试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The exercises try both.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:46.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上还把交接也列进了编排工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture also lists handoffs among the orchestration tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.89,0:10:51.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些教程是把 agent 当工具用；第 7 讲会简单讲讲交接\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}These tutorials use agents as tools; lecture 7 sketches handoffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.58,0:10:55.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Travel Planner 这个 notebook 演练的是课上那趟旅行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Travel Planner notebook rehearses the lecture's trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.08,0:10:59.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,复制一份，加上你的密钥，再安装它 pin 了版本的 agents 包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Copy it, add your key, and install its pinned agents package.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.22,0:11:02.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,巴黎缩成了一份模拟清单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Paris shrinks to a mock catalog:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.67,0:11:06.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,3 个城市、6 家酒店、5 个搜索工具和一个 finalize 工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}3 cities, 6 hotels, 5 search tools and a finalize tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.73,0:11:08.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么都不会真的预订\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}booking nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:12.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在课程团队保存的运行里，第 1 轮问的是加州的哪个城市\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the staff's saved run, turn 1 asks which California city.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:15.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 轮做了五次搜索，给出几个选项\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Turn 2 runs five searches and offers options.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:19.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 3 轮里用户做出选择，模型调用 finalize\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In turn 3 the user picks, the model calls finalize,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:23.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回复里列出确切的计划，并请用户回答 yes\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the reply shows the exact plan and asks for a yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:24.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是关卡\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:28.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型发起的 finalize 调用只能提议\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A finalize call from the model can only propose:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:32.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果计划不是已批准的那一份，代码就把它存为待批准\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if the plan isn't the approved one, the code stores it as pending,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:34.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并返回 needs confirmation\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and returns needs_confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:39.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,批准放在另一个函数 apply confirmation 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Approval lives in a separate function, apply_confirmation:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:42.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有明确的 yes，才会把待批准的计划复制为已批准\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}only an explicit yes copies pending to approved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.92,0:11:55.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为 apply confirmation 处理的是人发来的消息\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Because apply_confirmation runs on the human's message,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.39,0:11:56.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 agent 启动之前运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}before the agent starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.23,0:12:02.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第 3 轮里，什么都没被批准，所以每次重试都会盖上同一个印章\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside turn 3, nothing is approved, so every retry gets the same stamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.38,0:12:04.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 轮：人输入 yes\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Turn 4: the human types yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:08.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,印章翻成已批准，finalize 运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The stamp flips to approved, finalize runs,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:14.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Python 逐行算出预算：2690 美元，上限 6000\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and Python builds the budget line by line: 2,690 of the 6,000 dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.93,0:12:17.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 自带的测试核对 Python 算出的数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notebook's own test checks Python's number.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.00,0:12:21.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用户看到的内容来自检查过的状态，而不是模型写的文字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What the user sees comes from checked state, not the model's prose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:26.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,跳过检查的行程会抛出异常，这是硬护栏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An itinerary that skipped the check raises an error, a hard guardrail;
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.74,0:12:31.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型文字里出现美元金额，只会打印一条警告，这是软护栏\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a dollar amount in the model's prose only prints a warning, a soft one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:37.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把成功标准放在指令里，把护栏放在决策者里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture puts success criteria in the instructions, and guardrails in the decision maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.79,0:12:41.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 notebook 把两者都写进代码，模型怎么说都绕不过去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This notebook keeps both in code the model can't talk its way past,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.61,0:12:43.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码就放在行动工具上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on the action tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.37,0:12:46.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每一轮都要付费；暂停一下，把这四轮跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every turn is paid; pause, and run the four turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.62,0:12:52.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一个 notebook 给每位读者写一份奶酪简报\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The last notebook writes a cheese newsletter per reader,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:55.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用的是 Microsoft 的 Agent Framework，版本 pin 住了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with Microsoft's Agent Framework, pinned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:59.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 USERS 单元格里，填上你自己和一个朋友，保留两项\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the USERS cell, put in yourself and a friend, and keep two entries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:02.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,邮件只是预览；什么都不会发出去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Email is preview only; nothing is sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.87,0:13:05.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,编排 agent 有三个工具\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The orchestrator gets three tools:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.03,0:13:08.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个带网页搜索的研究员、一个编辑，以及 send email\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a researcher with web search, an editor, and send_email.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.90,0:13:12.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最多 16 次迭代，一次只做一个工具调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At most 16 iterations, one tool call at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:16.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在课程团队保存的运行里，第一个城市用了四次编辑调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the staff's saved run, the first city took four editor calls;
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:21.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码会校验每份草稿，把任何错误都作为工具的结果交回去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the code validates every draft and hands any errors back as the tool's result.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.97,0:13:24.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 send email 把 HTML 写进了一个文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then send_email wrote the HTML to a file.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.19,0:13:28.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那次运行有四位读者；今天的名单是两位\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That run had four readers; today's list makes two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:29.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在来看 harness\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the harness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.04,0:13:34.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,编排 agent 停下来以后，Python 不管它说了什么，检查两件事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}When the orchestrator stops, Python ignores its words and checks two things:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.93,0:13:38.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有没有来自 send email 的回执，那个文件在不在磁盘上？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}is there a receipt from send_email, and is that file on disk?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:40.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果没有，这次运行就算失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If not, the run fails;
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:43.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,成功看的是回执，而不是它声称了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}success is a receipt, not a claim.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:45.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,对比一下只写在 prompt 里的规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Compare a rule that lives only in the prompt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.19,0:13:49.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,编辑收到的指令是：不要嵌入 URL\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The editor is told: no embedded URLs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:55.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,保存的预览里还是有一个，因为没有代码去检查；便条不等于检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The saved preview has one anyway, because no code checks for it; a note is not a check.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:59.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的 Self-RAG 和 Corrective RAG 给检索结果打分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's Self-RAG and Corrective RAG grade their retrieval
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:01.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也是出于同样的理由：别信，要查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}for the same reason: don't trust, check.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:04.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下节课把这个外层叫作 harness\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next lecture calls this outer layer the harness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:08.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,网页搜索按次计费；暂停一下，跑一遍演示\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Web search is billed per call; pause, and run the demo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.58,0:14:14.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,该拆掉了：按 Ctrl-C 停掉 web 服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Tear down: Ctrl+C stops the web server.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:19.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外的 git status 显示了改名后的目录，还有你的 Python pin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra git status shows the renamed folders and your Python pin;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.22,0:14:23.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 .env 文件、虚拟环境和 lock 文件，都被忽略了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}.env, the virtual environment and the lock file are ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:27.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 agent 的 .adk 目录里，session 没有被忽略\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The sessions in the agent's .adk/ folder aren't ignored,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.44,0:14:33.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以别 commit 它们，用完以后把 1.6 GB 的虚拟环境删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so don't commit them, and delete the 1.6 gigabyte virtual environment when you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.72,0:14:36.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在每个 notebook 里，断开连接并删除运行时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In each notebook, disconnect and delete the runtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.15,0:14:41.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,服务账号密钥放在 llm-rag 旁边，绝不放进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Keep the service account key beside llm-rag, never inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:45.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课程结束时把另外两个密钥删掉，或者给它们设上限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and delete or cap the other two keys when the course ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:49.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是课上的 agent 结构图，填上了今天的代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here's the lecture's anatomy, filled with today's code.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.90,0:14:52.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,核心是 Gemini 和 OpenAI 的模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Gemini and OpenAI models as the core;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:56.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,指令是 prompt 和输出类型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}prompts and output types as instructions;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:59.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,工具有手写的、加装饰器的，或者走 MCP 的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}tools by hand, decorated, or over MCP;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:02.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,记忆是消息历史和 session 状态\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}history and session state as memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.70,0:15:06.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,动态控制就是框架的循环，或者手写的两次调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Dynamic control is the framework's loop, or two calls by hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:12.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的公式，LLM 加上推理、指令和工具，多了两块\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's formula, LLM plus reasoning, instructions and tools, gains two pieces:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:17.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,框架运行的循环，以及由你的代码强制执行的检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a loop the framework runs, and checks that your own code enforces.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:19.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自测一下\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Test yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.26,0:15:22.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一题：谁来运行这个函数，第 2 次调用里又发回什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One: who runs the function, and what goes back in call 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:25.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二题：mode 设为 any 改变了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two: what does mode="any" change,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:26.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么只在第 1 次调用上？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and why only on call 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:28.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三题：agent 循环靠什么结束\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three: what ends an agent loop,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:32.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,框架加了什么上限，那又是哪个组件？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}what cap do frameworks add, and which block is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:35.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第四题：总结器怎么在没有消息的情况下拿到计划？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Four: how does the summarizer get the plan without a message?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.15,0:15:39.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第五题：什么决定一次 harness 运行成功了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Five: what decides that a harness run succeeded,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:40.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么不是模型说了算？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and why not the model's word?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:45.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,答案和每条命令都在练习和学习指南里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Answers and every command are in the exercises and the study guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:48.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,下节课：harness 本身\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next lecture: the harness itself.
